{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12364","headline":"巨鱼纵大壑 · 钱起","name":"巨鱼纵大壑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巨鱼纵大壑，遂性似乘时。\n奋跃风生鬣，腾凌浪鼓鳍。\n龙摅回地轴，鲲化想天池。\n方快吞舟意，尤殊在藻嬉。\n倾危嗟幕燕，隐晦诮泥龟。\n喻士逢明主，才猷得所施。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12364.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12364","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}